cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Livewire in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "Livewire: stateful network replay and protocol robustness testing for industrial systems"
abstract: >-
  Livewire replays a captured TCP session against a live host while realigning
  sequence and acknowledgement numbers into the new session's sequence space, so
  the peer treats the traffic as a genuine conversation rather than a replay. It
  dissects Modbus/TCP, DNP3 and MQTT, runs on Windows as well as Linux, and
  carries no runtime dependencies.
type: software
authors:
